ext{proj}}_{S}\\,x={\\text{proj}}_{v}\\,x+{\\text{proj}}_{w}\\,x.\n$$\n\nSo, we first find the orthogonal projections of $x$ onto $\\text{Span}{{a}_{1}}$ and $\\text{Span}{{a}_{2}}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{v}\\,x & =\\frac{x\\cdot v}{v\\cdot v}v=\\frac{(-8)\\cdot 4+14\\cdot (-1)+2\\cdot 2}{{4}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}}v=-2[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {\\text{proj}}_{w}\\,x & =\\frac{x\\cdot w}{w\\cdot w}w=\\frac{(-8)\\cdot 1+14\\cdot 2+2\\cdot (-1)}{{1}^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}w=3[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & ={\\text{proj}}_{v}\\,x+{\\text{proj}}_{w}\\,x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-8 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -4\\text{ }\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-81580/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "acb4bd03-9b89-5775-a700-e1f3ea9fa62e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-81580"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-81601/selection/34325bd3b7263abb29706604ca52dc13883cb7570290ba57fae43195c879664a" :answer/id #uuid "7df928a2-bba2-5d88-824f-e306bc84b5b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81601/selection/955f4cd595e6c9b18899816a70885fbe3b7f4a9f4e7d5cdb48f7a3f1f1bb29d9" :answer/id #uuid "af7e7b01-e1d2-5c94-8a04-bd61ddad4d22" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-81601/selection/8e67e4a52f5fc43858fca551dffb06922edacaa50dfe2498a51ab6f05cc53801" :answer/id #uuid "441abd51-c9f9-5c10-aaf5-0ea9b6fd30b0" :answer/type :a